; claude: a small Scheme, and HtDP's teaching languages over it
; (languages/README.md): Scheme (the values, the code, printing),
; Scheme_image (2htdp/image's images as data), Scheme_syntax (the
; special forms, the derived ones rewritten), Scheme_prims (the
; built-ins), Scheme_prelude (map, filter, sort... in Scheme),
; Scheme_eval (the CESK machine: call/cc, tail calls, fuel),
; Scheme_step (the Beginning Student stepper). Read by sexpr/'s reader,
; shared with lisp/. TinyDrScheme (apps/devtools/) is its host.
;
; Pure OCaml, no Playground. A private library, installed as part of
; elm_playground.
(library
 (name scheme)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries sexpr)
)
